CORE
main.cpp
--cpp11
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
^.*direct assignments to arrays not permitted$
--
Regression for the "direct assignments to arrays not permitted"
bug hit by MSVC's <xstring> SSO buffer (`union _Bxty { char _Buf[N];
_Bxty() : _Buf() {} }`).  Per [dcl.init]/8 value-initialization of
an array performs element-wise zero-initialization; we must not
emit a direct assignment to an array lvalue, which [expr.ass]
rejects.
